th-shiji126-004","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","title":"楚莊王","kind":"royal_rank","mode":"attestation","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p006","quote":"優孟，故楚之樂人也。長八尺，多辯，常以談笑諷諫。楚莊王之時，有所愛馬，衣以文繡，置之華屋之下，席以露床，啗以棗脯。馬病肥死，使群臣喪之，欲以棺槨大夫禮葬之。左右爭之，以為不可。王下令曰：「有敢以馬諫者，罪至死。」優孟聞之，入殿門。仰天大哭。王驚而問其故。優孟曰：「馬者王之所愛也，以楚國堂堂之大，何求不得，而以大夫禮葬之，薄，請以人君禮葬之。」王曰：「何如？」對曰：「臣請以彫玉為棺，文梓為槨，楩楓豫章為題湊，發甲卒為穿壙，老弱負土，齊趙陪位於前，韓魏翼衛其后，廟食太牢，奉以萬戶之邑。諸侯聞之，皆知大王賤人而貴馬也。」王曰：「寡人之過一至此乎！為之柰何？」優孟曰：「請為大王六畜葬之。以壟灶為槨，銅歷為棺，齎以薑棗，薦以木蘭，祭以糧稻，衣以火光，葬之於人腹腸。」於是王乃使以馬屬太官，無令天下久聞也。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji126-004:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p006","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"楚莊王","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0024","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"明示封拜與文獻用稱分開；未知授任年及終點保持未知，不以死亡自動終止官爵。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p006","text":"優孟，故楚之樂人也。長八尺，多辯，常以談笑諷諫。楚莊王之時，有所愛馬，衣以文繡，置之華屋之下，席以露床，啗以棗脯。馬病肥死，使群臣喪之，欲以棺槨大夫禮葬之。左右爭之，以為不可。王下令曰：「有敢以馬諫者，罪至死。」優孟聞之，入殿門。仰天大哭。王驚而問其故。優孟曰：「馬者王之所愛也，以楚國堂堂之大，何求不得，而以大夫禮葬之，薄，請以人君禮葬之。」王曰：「何如？」對曰：「臣請以彫玉為棺，文梓為槨，楩楓豫章為題湊，發甲卒為穿壙，老弱負土，齊趙陪位於前，韓魏翼衛其后，廟食太牢，奉以萬戶之邑。諸侯聞之，皆知大王賤人而貴馬也。」王曰：「寡人之過一至此乎！為之柰何？」優孟曰：「請為大王六畜葬之。以壟灶為槨，銅歷為棺，齎以薑棗，薦以木蘭，祭以糧稻，衣以火光，葬之於人腹腸。」於是王乃使以馬屬太官，無令天下久聞也。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0106","start":106,"end":108,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0120","start":120,"end":121,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0127","start":127,"end":129,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0250","start":250,"end":252,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0260","start":260,"end":261,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0279","start":279,"end":281,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0286","start":286,"end":288,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m006-0334","start":334,"end":335,"surface":"王","kind":"person","person_id":"hzu_071_bnq","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-126-huaji","book_id":"b-shiji-126","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji126-huaji"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:p007","text":"楚相孫叔敖知其賢人也，善待之。病且死，屬其子曰：「我死，汝必貧困。若往見優孟，言我孫叔敖之子也。」居數年，其子窮困負薪，逢優孟，與言曰：「我，孫叔敖子也。父且死時，屬我貧困往見優孟。」優孟曰：「若無遠有所之。」即為孫叔敖衣冠，抵掌談語。歲餘，像孫叔敖，楚王及左右不能別也。莊王置酒，優孟前為壽。莊王大驚，以為孫叔敖復生也，欲以為相。優孟曰：「請歸與婦計之，三日而為相。」莊王許之。三日後，優孟復來。王曰：「婦言謂何？」孟曰：「婦言慎無為，楚相不足為也。如孫叔敖之為楚相，盡忠為廉以治楚，楚王得以霸。今死，其子無立錐之地，貧困負薪以自飲食。必如孫叔敖，不如自殺。」因歌曰：「山居耕田苦，難以得食。起而為吏，身貪鄙者餘財，不顧恥辱。身死家室富，又恐受賕枉法，為姦觸大罪，身死而家滅。貪吏安可為也！念為廉吏，奉法守職，竟死不敢為非。廉吏安可為也！楚相孫叔敖持廉至死，方今妻子窮困負薪而食，不足為也！」於是莊王謝優孟，乃召孫叔敖子，封之寢丘四百戶，以奉其祀。后十世不絕。此知可以言時矣。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0002","start":2,"end":5,"surface":"孫叔敖","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0020","start":20,"end":22,"surface":"其子","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0041","start":41,"end":46,"surface":"孫叔敖之子","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0053","start":53,"end":55,"surface":"其子","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0061","start":61,"end":63,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0071","start":71,"end":75,"surface":"孫叔敖子","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0088","start":88,"end":90,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0092","start":92,"end":94,"surface":"優孟","kind":"person","person_id":"3sn_ajy_26l","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0107","start":107,"end":110,"surface":"孫叔敖","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-126-huaji:m007-0122","start":122,"end":125,"surface":"孫叔敖","kind":"person","person_id":"fom_gr9_c8v","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji